{"id":"a2335a033d2b39a0","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-thm-generic-extension-properties.md","title":"Generic Extension Properties","display":"thm-generic-extension-properties — Generic Extension Properties","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-generic-extension-properties","aliases":["58-thm-generic-extension-properties","Generic Extension Properties","V[G] Structure"],"display":"thm-generic-extension-properties — Generic Extension Properties","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-generic-extension-properties"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-generic-extension-properties</span><span>Generic Extension Properties</span><span>V[G] Structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-generic-extension-properties — Generic Extension Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76dde059f166d3e6\" href=\"?note=76dde059f166d3e6\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md\">../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"393515cdafde1b06\" href=\"?note=393515cdafde1b06\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},G\\in V\">\\(M,N,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},G\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S,\\mathrm{Generic},\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S,\\mathrm{Generic},\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}\\)</span> (set-coded predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> is the membership-language theory and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> is the ordinal class</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC})\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},M)\n\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,\\mathbb P,G)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Model}(N,\\mathrm{ZFC})\n\\land(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M=\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap N)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC})\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},M)\n\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,\\mathbb P,G)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Model}(N,\\mathrm{ZFC})\n\\land(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M=\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap N)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>ZFC preservation is expressed by the set-coded model predicate, not a free satisfaction glyph.</li>\n<li>The equality of ordinal sets states that forcing adds no ordinals.</li>\n<li>Cardinals: may collapse or change.</li>\n<li>A ground model is definable in its set-forcing extension from a suitable parameter.</li>\n<li>Generic extensions add new sets while preserving the ordinal structure.</li>\n<li>The ambient ground can often be recovered definably from the extension.</li>\n<li>Applications: set-theoretic geology.</li>\n<li>Key: relationship between <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V[G]\">\\(V[G]\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md","status":"resolved","id":"76dde059f166d3e6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-generic.md","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"393515cdafde1b06","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTM}_S,\\mathrm{Generic},\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Model}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension\\text{-}properties}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZFC})\n\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},M)\n\\land\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,\\mathbb P,G)\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Model}(N,\\mathrm{ZFC})\n\\land(\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap M=\\mathrm{Ord}\\cap N)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V[G]","display":false}],"bytes":1668,"backlinks":[{"id":"e91996b4cded8a6b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-thm-generic-extension-properties.md|58-thm-generic-extension-properties]]（batch04）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-191","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-condensation.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-definability.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-generic-extension.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-is-transitive.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC.md]]\n[[58-thm-MM.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equal-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equals-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-absoluteness-calculation.md]]\n[[58-thm-ac-wellorder-equivalent.md]]\n[[58-thm-aleph-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-completeness.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category-theory.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category.md]]\n[[58-thm-banach-tarski.md]]\n[[58-thm-beth-function-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-boolean-valued-model.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-cardinality.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-determinacy-proof.md]]\n[[58-thm-bounded-forcing-axioms.md]]\n[[58-thm-cantor.md]]\n[[58-thm-cardinal-multiplication.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-filter-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-guessing.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-intersection-proper.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-intersection.md]]\n[[58-thm-coanalytic-separation.md]]\n[[58-thm-coding-universe.md]]\n[[58-thm-cofinality-regular.md]]\n[[58-thm-cohen-forcing-CH.md]]\n[[58-thm-collapse-forcing.md]]\n[[58-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[58-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy.md]]\n[[58-thm-continuum-hypothesis.md]]\n[[58-thm-countable-choice.md]]\n[[58-thm-covering-lemma.md]]\n[[58-thm-dense-set-lemma.md]]\n[[58-thm-dependent-choice.md]]\n[[58-thm-determinacy.md]]\n[[58-thm-diamond-implies-CH.md]]\n[[58-thm-diamond-properties.md]]\n